  "guide": {
    "feature_id": "meta.value-based-lookalike-audiences",
    "name": "Value-based Lookalike Audiences",
    "vendor": "Meta",
    "platform": "Paid Social",
    "capability_ids": [
      "meta.lookalike_audiences.value-based-lookalike-audience"
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "A value-based Lookalike Audience finds new people who resemble your existing customers, using a source audience that carries a value column. Choose a source that reflects the customers you want more of, because source quality shapes the result.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              },
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "It is a variant of standard lookalike audiences, created from a custom audience that includes a value column. It is an audience you build and then use in ad sets, so it acts as a targeting input.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Meta's system uses information such as demographics, interests and behaviours from your source audience to find new people with similar qualities, then delivers your ad to that audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "You choose audience size with a percentage range. Smaller percentages match the source more closely; larger ones give a broader audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              },
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "How the value column changes the modelling is not explained by Meta, so do not assume it weights the match by value.",
            "status": "not_documented",
            "evidence": [],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you have a custom audience with a value column and want to reach new people who resemble your customers. Meta notes that a source built from your best customers may give better results than one built from all customers, depending on your goals.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your ads are about financial products and services, employment or housing opportunities, because lookalike audiences are limited or unavailable for these. Options are also limited for audiences that include people under 18.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it unchanged for campaigns reaching people in the European Region, where privacy-driven changes may affect campaigns and reporting.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.lookalike_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/164749007013531",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Lookalike Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "setup",
        "summary": "The documented steps start once your source audience with a value column is ready; creating that source is covered in a separate Meta guide not supplied here.",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Go to Audiences in Meta's ads tools.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Click the Create audience drop-down menu and select Lookalike Audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "For your source, choose the custom audience with a value column that you created.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Choose your desired audience size with the slider.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Click Create audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.value_lookalike",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/458132024732845",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a value-based Lookalike Audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
